<title>UK: Brit Midland to code-share with Gulf Air.</title>
<headline>Brit Midland to code-share with Gulf Air.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Privately-owned British Midland Airways and middle eastern carrier Gulf Air said on Wednesday they had formed a new code-sharing alliance which will link British Midland's UK domestic network through London Heathrow with Gulf's services to the Arabian Gulf and beyond.</p>
<p>British Midland is 40 percent owned by Scandinavian Airlines System.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
